After seek : The Quangle Wangle sat
Length     : 56 bytes
Replication: 1
--- listStatus /user/student ---
  quangle.txt
--- globStatus *.txt ---
  quangle.txt

Verify HDFS file:

hdfs dfs -cat /user/student/quangle.txt

Expected:

On the top of the Crumpetty Tree
The Quangle Wangle sat

Add second file:

echo "hello hdfs" | hdfs dfs -put - /user/student/notes.txt

Run again:

hadoop jar hdfsdemo.jar HdfsDemo

Then both quangle.txt and notes.txt should appear in list/glob output.

Exit:

exit

Then:

docker compose down
Common Program 2 errors

If:

no configuration file provided: not found

you ran docker compose up -d before creating docker-compose.yml, or you are in the wrong folder.

Check:

dir

or:

ls

You should see:

docker-compose.yml
config

If:

javac: command not found

the Java compiler is missing in that fresh container. This happened during Mac practice. It is not part of the normal exam procedure.

If:

file already exists

for some HDFS operation, delete it with:

hdfs dfs -rm /path/to/file

For the provided fs.create(file) program, overwrite is normally allowed.

